  "Tenvora privacy": "Privasi Tenvora",
  "Tenvora stores your account email, profile, workspace information, business records, receipt photos, and AI conversations on its hosted server. These records are available to authorized members of your workspace according to their role. Passwords are hashed; sign-in credentials are stored securely on this device.": "Tenvora menyimpan email akun, profil, informasi ruang kerja, catatan bisnis, foto bukti pembayaran, dan percakapan AI di server yang dihosting. Anggota berwenang dapat mengakses catatan sesuai perannya. Kata sandi disimpan dalam bentuk hash; kredensial login disimpan dengan aman di perangkat ini.",
  "Camera and photo access are used only when you choose a receipt or product image. Only the selected image is uploaded. Google sign-in sends a Google identity token to the Tenvora server. AI requests send your question and relevant business context to Google Gemini. Avoid including sensitive information you do not want processed by the AI provider.": "Kamera dan akses foto hanya digunakan saat Anda memilih gambar bukti pembayaran atau produk. Hanya gambar yang dipilih yang diunggah. Login Google mengirim token identitas Google ke server Tenvora. Permintaan AI mengirim pertanyaan dan konteks bisnis terkait ke Google Gemini. Hindari informasi sensitif yang tidak ingin Anda proses melalui penyedia AI.",
  "Delete your account from Settings. Your profile, credentials and AI conversations are removed. If you are the only workspace member, the workspace and its business data are also deleted. Shared business records remain for the other members with your actor identity removed. The last administrator of a team must add another administrator first. Deletion from active storage does not instantly erase copies in existing provider backups.": "Hapus akun melalui Pengaturan. Profil, kredensial, dan percakapan AI Anda dihapus. Jika Anda satu-satunya anggota, ruang kerja dan data bisnisnya juga dihapus. Catatan bisnis bersama tetap tersedia bagi anggota lain tanpa identitas Anda sebagai pelaku tindakan. Administrator terakhir harus menambahkan administrator lain terlebih dahulu. Penghapusan dari penyimpanan aktif tidak langsung menghapus salinan dalam cadangan penyedia yang sudah ada.",
  "Support and privacy contact": "Kontak dukungan dan privasi",
  "After uninstalling, use the account-deletion page on the website.": "Setelah menghapus aplikasi, gunakan halaman penghapusan akun di situs web.",
